---
title: Galaxy Markdown Architecture Overview
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant sources as Context Sources
    participant parse as markdown_parse.py
    participant util as markdown_util.py
    box Handlers
        participant ready as ReadyForExport
        participant basic as ToBasicMarkdown
    end
    participant frontend as Frontend
    participant output as Output

    Note over sources,output: Input Layer
    Note over sources: Workflow Markdown<br>Tool Output Markdown<br>Page API (encoded)<br>History Markdown (future)
    sources->>parse: context-specific format

    Note over sources,output: Validation Layer
    activate parse
    parse->>parse: syntax validation<br>(no Galaxy deps)
    parse-->>util: valid markdown
    deactivate parse

    Note over sources,output: Resolution Layer
    activate util
    util->>util: decode IDs<br>resolve references
    Note right of util: output="results" → id=12345<br>step="bwa" → job_id=67890

    Note over sources,output: Export Layer
    alt Frontend Rendering
        util->>ready: lazy export
        activate ready
        ready-->>frontend: metadata + directives
        deactivate ready
    else PDF Export
        util->>basic: eager export
        activate basic
        basic-->>output: standard markdown<br>→ HTML → PDF
        deactivate basic
    end
    deactivate util

    Note over sources,output: Render Layer
    activate frontend
    frontend->>frontend: Markdown.vue<br>SectionWrapper<br>MarkdownGalaxy
    frontend->>frontend: Element components<br>+ Pinia stores
    frontend-->>output: Interactive UI
    deactivate frontend
